{"id":634,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"カトリック全人教育を基盤とする学び","feature_description":"カトリック全人教育を基盤とする学びを教育の中心に据え、教科の学びと学校生活を結び付けながら、生徒が自ら考え行動する力を育てます。基礎となる知識や技能を着実に身に付けるとともに、探究、対話、行事、部活動などの経験を通して、多様な仲間と協働し課題に向き合います。一人ひとりが目標を見つけ、学びを深め、社会や世界に関わる視野を広げられるよう支える教育です。","clubs":[{"id":11842,"name":"卓球部","category":"その他","source_url":"https://www.futabagakuen-jh.ed.jp/jsh/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11843,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"その他","source_url":"https://www.futabagakuen-jh.ed.jp/jsh/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11844,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"その他","source_url":"https://www.futabagakuen-jh.ed.jp/jsh/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11845,"name":"英語演劇部","category":"その他","source_url":"https://www.futabagakuen-jh.ed.jp/jsh/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11846,"name":"演劇部","category":"その他","source_url":"https://www.futabagakuen-jh.ed.jp/jsh/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11847,"name":"音楽部","category":"その他","source_url":"https://www.futabagakuen-jh.ed.jp/jsh/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11848,"name":"軽音楽部","category":"その他","source_url":"https://www.futabagakuen-jh.ed.jp/jsh/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11849,"name":"写真部","category":"その他","source_url":"https://www.futabagakuen-jh.ed.jp/jsh/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11850,"name":"ダンス部","category":"その他","source_url":"https://www.futabagakuen-jh.ed.jp/jsh/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11851,"name":"卓球班","category":"その他","source_url":"https://www.futabagakuen-jh.ed.jp/jsh/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11852,"name":"バスケットボール班","category":"その他","source_url":"https://www.futabagakuen-jh.ed.jp/jsh/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11853,"name":"バレーボール班","category":"その他","source_url":"https://www.futabagakuen-jh.ed.jp/jsh/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11854,"name":"化学班","category":"その他","source_